          "name": "maximum potential equity interest",
          "value": "100",
          "unit": "percent",
          "sentence": "But the company asked for clearance of up to 100% to account for potential future investments, which the FCC granted, citing in part that access to more capital would strengthen the broadcast industry and was therefore \"in the public interest.\"",
